 "transcript": [
  "[action] (to the eldest son, the second son) Wang Lung looks at his sons and then at Pear Blossom.",
  "[action] (to the eldest son) The second son returns home.",
  "the eldest son (to Wang Lung): \"We are setting up a great store of grain in the town and we will sell it there and we will get a good profit out of it,\"",
  "[silence] (to the eldest son) Wang Lung says nothing.",
  "the eldest son (to Wang Lung): \"We will sell and buy as we will, and we will have what we please, and it is not fitting that you, a man who are so old and so poor, should come into our house and tell us what we may do,\"",
  "[action] The eldest son pushes his father.",
  "[action] (to the eldest son) The second son pushes his brother.",
  "Wang Lung (to the eldest son): \"Well, and I am your father, and you are my sons, and I am not so poor as you think---\"",
  "[action] The eldest son enters his father's house.",
  "[says] (to the second son) The eldest son invites his father to join him in his house.",
  "Wang Lung (to the eldest son): \"Well, and it is a little cold, and I will come,\"",
  "[action] Wang Lung follows his son slowly.",
  "[action] (to the eldest son) Wang Lung enters his son's house.",
  "[action] Wang Lung looks about the room.",
  "[action] The eldest son sits his father on a bench.",
  "the eldest son (to Wang Lung): \"Well, and it is a good house and a good wife, and there is enough for us both,\"",
  "Wang Lung (to the eldest son): \"You have a good woman!\"",
  "[action] The eldest son looks at his wife with pride.",
  "[action] The eldest son invites his wife to join them.",
  "[says] The eldest son introduces his wife."
